@host = http://localhost:5087
@container = reports

### Create a container
POST {{host}}/api/containers/{{container}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadataJson"

{"owner":"samples"}
--boundary--

### List containers
GET {{host}}/api/containers

### Upload a resource (409 if it exists; add ?overwrite=true to replace it)
POST {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from Resourcefull.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadataJson"

{"author":"me"}
--boundary--

### List the container's resources
GET {{host}}/api/containers/{{container}}

### Get a resource's info
GET {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=hello.txt

### Download a resource (add &inline=true to display images, PDFs and plain text in the browser)
# @name download
GET {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=hello.txt&stream=true

### Download it again only if it changed: 304 Not Modified while the ETag still matches
GET {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=hello.txt&stream=true
If-None-Match: {{download.response.headers.ETag}}

### Upload the request body (201 for a new name, 200 when it replaces one)
# @name put
PUT {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=notes.txt
Content-Type: text/plain

Written with a PUT.

### Replace it only if it's still the version you read: 412 Precondition Failed if it changed since
PUT {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=notes.txt
Content-Type: text/plain
If-Match: {{put.response.headers.ETag}}

Changed, but only if nobody else changed it first.

### Delete a resource
DELETE {{host}}/api/resources/{{container}}?resourceName=hello.txt

### Delete the container
DELETE {{host}}/api/containers/{{container}}
